{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120934","id":3990730440,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7t3bbI","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120934","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120934.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120934.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120934","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120934/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120934/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120934/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/9fe496ea256cfad8f7b822034daa0eaee9e0e008","number":120934,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"GDScript: Reload scripts that depend on changed scripts","user":{"login":"Infiland","id":88491175,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4NDkxMTc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/88491175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland","html_url":"https://github.com/Infiland","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infiland/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes godotengine/godot#83346.\n\nWhen a script exported a property typed with an enum from another script, changes to the enum provider were not reflected in the inspector until the dependent script was edited or reloaded manually.\n\nThis updates GDScript reloads to also include scripts that depend on the script being reloaded, using the existing parser inverse dependency tracking. That lets exported property metadata be rebuilt when an external enum changes.\n\nA regression test was added for a `class_name` enum provider used by an exported property in another script.\n\nTested with:\n\n- `scons platform=macos target=editor dev_build=yes tests=yes debug_symbols=no -j8`\n- `scons platform=macos target=template_release tests=yes debug_symbols=no -j8`\n- `bin/godot.macos.editor.dev.arm64 --test --test-case=\"*[Modules][GDScript] Reloading a script refreshes dependent enum exports*\"`\n- `bin/godot.macos.editor.dev.arm64 --test --source-file=\"*gdscript_test_runner_suite.h\"`\n- `python3 misc/scripts/file_format.py modules/gdscript/gdscript_cache.h modules/gdscript/gdscript_cache.cpp modules/gdscript/gdscript.cpp modules/gdscript/tests/gdscript_test_runner_suite.h`\n- `python3 misc/scripts/validate_includes.py modules/gdscript/gdscript_cache.h modules/gdscript/gdscript_cache.cpp modules/gdscript/gdscript.cpp modules/gdscript/tests/gdscript_test_runner_suite.h`\n- `git diff --check`\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":fals